question_llm: ollama local model ornith:35b

knowledge {
  uhc {
    1. Look Up the Practitioner by NPI:
    ```
    curl --get "https://flex.optum.com/fhirpublic/R4/Practitioner" \
  -H "Accept: application/fhir+json" \
  --data-urlencode "identifier=http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/us-npi|1619004058"
    ```

    2. Check the returned JSON Bundle for entry[0].resource.id (the internal FHIR practitioner ID).

    3. Once you have the internal id from Step 1, query PractitionerRole to see linked networks, locations, and organizations:
    ```
    curl --get "https://flex.optum.com/fhirpublic/R4/PractitionerRole" \
  -H "Accept: application/fhir+json" \
  --data-urlencode "practitioner=Practitioner/<PRACTITIONER_ID>" \
  --data-urlencode "_include=PractitionerRole:network" \
  --data-urlencode "_include=PractitionerRole:location" \
  --data-urlencode "_include=PractitionerRole:organization"
    ```
  }
}

task (completed) {
